  "title": "Jubilant Light Mexican Poblanos Tlayudas",
  "description": "A cultured and chewy Mexican dish featuring mint and poblano peppers, served on toasted tlayudas, this recipe is a twist on traditional Mexican cuisine, with a light and refreshing flavor profile.",
